# --- never commit an unpublished-sequence registry -------------------------------------------
# The documented mechanism accepts ANY path via ARTIFACTAUDIT_CONFIDENTIAL_SEQS, so pinning one basename
# is not enough. These patterns cover the documented default, the obvious variants, and the
# directories a run is told to write into.
confidential-seqs.txt
*confidential*seq*
*.confidential
state/
out/
